  "image": "map/world.jpg",
  "alt": "Tall ink-and-gouache painting of the whole French village, read from top to bottom as one journey: snowy mountains and a green valley with a chalet, observatory, farm, greenhouses and a lake at the top; a main road winds down from the mountain pass past a twin-towered cathedral, the flag-topped town hall square, the clock-tower village square and the market with its weighing tower; then two domed houses of prayer, a pink café street, a cottage lane with a wash-house, a columned museum and a red-brick university campus; then a stadium and theater, big-top park with a maze and pond, and lavender heart gardens; the river widens past the bank quay's wind turbine and canal island and the red-cross hospital, and the road ends at the coast beside a glass-roofed railway station, port, harbor boats and an airport pier. Bridges carry the roads over the river; quiet woods to the upper left and a bayou delta to the lower left are left open.",
